#: docs/delivery/support.md:8
msgid "当前精确支持范围"
msgstr "Current exact support scope"

#: docs/delivery/support.md:10
msgid ""
"当前生产入口为 STM32F4，迁入的具体实现仍限定 STM32F407VET6／STM32F407ZGT6。 两者共享系列源码，Flash "
"密度、封装和允许引脚来自精确事实。其他 F4 型号尚需逐项 接入与验证，不能由官方 HAL 或器件宏存在推定支持。"
msgstr ""
"The production entry point is STM32F4. Migrated concrete implementations "
"remain limited to STM32F407VET6/STM32F407ZGT6. They share series sources, "
"while Flash density, package and allowed pins come from exact facts. Other F4"
" parts require individual integration and verification; official HAL or "
"device macros do not imply support."

