#: docs/delivery/support.md:26
msgid ""
"精确资源权威是 [soc.json](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/soc.json)、 "
"[routes.json](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/routes.json)和各 [Board 包](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/boards/README.md)。 当前 F407 时钟仍为受审 "
"HSE8／168 MHz profile；不能配置任意时钟或运行期变频。"
msgstr ""
"Exact resource authorities are [soc.json](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/soc.json), "
"[routes.json](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/routes.json) and the [Board "
"packages](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/boards/README.md). Current F407 clocks still use the reviewed HSE8/168"
" MHz profile; arbitrary clocks and runtime scaling are not configurable."

#: docs/delivery/support.md:30
msgid ""
"[器件目录](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/devices.json)只描述官方宏、启动和 IRQ 的 SDK 编译事实，不为其他 F4 "
"型号建立驱动、Board 或运行时模式资格。"
msgstr ""
"The [device catalogue](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/devices.json) records only official "
"macro, startup and IRQ facts for SDK compilation. It does not establish "
"driver, Board or runtime-mode qualification for other F4 parts."

